            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system is configured to produce a series of printed clips (14p). The system includes a source (42) of web material (40), a cutting station (46), a drive assembly (70, 72) and a printing station (48). The web material (40) is configured to pass through the system in a machine direction (44). The cutting station (46) is configured to cut a first portion of the web material (40) into at least a first clip (12), index the first portion after cutting, and sequentially cut a second portion of the web material (40) into at least a second clip (12). Cut portions of the web material (40) exit the cutting station (46) in a free loop (14u). A drive assembly (70, 72) is configured to feed web material of the free loop (14u) through the printing station (48) at a web speed. The printing station (48) is configured to print indicia (16) on a first surface (18f, 18b) of the cut portions of the web material (40).</p>
            </abstract>
